{
  "name": "dsh-bilingual-ui",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "DSH Web profile 插件：界面双语标签 —— 运行时把所有第三方插件的英文界面标签改写成「中文 + English」（命令弹窗 / 标签页 / 插件管理页），内置常用词词典，以后新装的插件也能自动双语；DSH 官方文案与已是中文的标签一律不动，设置左侧栏按原名保留（多个插件按标签文本定位左栏行，改写会让它们失效）。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./lib/index.js",
  "scripts": {
    "build": "node scripts/build.mjs",
    "test": "node scripts/build.mjs && node --test test/*.test.mjs"
  },
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": {
      "default": "./lib/client.js"
    },
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": []
    }
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml"
  ],
  "license": "MIT"
}
